        "type": "prompt-used",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "[**Prompt**:: Self Determination theory with the goal of becoming an expert lifelong self-educated knowledge worker]",
        "line_number": 21,
        "source": "topic-set-self-determination-theory-20251127123653.md",
        "char_start": 365,
        "char_end": 501
      },
      {
        "type": "the-purpose",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "This topic set connects the rigorous psychological framework of Self-Determination Theory (SDT) with the practical demands of becoming an expert, self-directed knowledge worker. It moves beyond general productivity advice to explore the psycho-motivational mechanisms—Autonomy, Competence, and Relatedness—that sustain lifelong intellectual growth. These topics are designed to generate deep, evidence-based strategies for maintaining intrinsic motivation, preventing cognitive burnout, and structuring a learning environment that fosters mastery. The goal is to provide a scientific blueprint for the modern autodidact to thrive in an information-dense economy.",
        "line_number": 31,
        "source": "topic-set-self-determination-theory-20251127123653.md",
        "char_start": 859,
        "char_end": 1541
